om a real example, then the formula. Most of my students stop memorising within a month.”</p></div></article></li><li data-video-id="showcase-4" class="aspect-[461/603] w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-[22rem] lg:w-[28.8125rem]"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Play Nabila Hossain&#x27;s video, Chemistry" class="relative block size-full cursor-pointer touch-manipulation overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] bg-[var(--color-surface-inverse)] text-left outline-1 -outline-offset-1 outline-[oklch(0_0_0/0.1)] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--color-primary-core)] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-none"><img src="/assets/avatar-demo/tutor/tutor4.png" alt="" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 461px, (min-width: 640px) 352px, 80vw" class="object-cover" data-testid="next-image"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/2 bg-[linear-gradient(to_top,oklch(0_0_0/0.72),transparent)]"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-5 bottom-5 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 sm:inset-x-6 sm:bottom-6"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-xl leading-[1.25] font-semibold text-[var(--color-neutral-white)] sm:text-2xl">Nabila Hossain</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-[1.5] text-[oklch(1_0_0/0.85)] sm:text-base">Chemistry</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--color-neutral-white)] text-[var(--color-primary-deep)] sm:size-14"><span class="absolute ml-0.5 size-[18px] bg-current [mask:url(/assets/ic/ic-play.png)_center/contain_no-repeat]" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none"></span></span></span></button></li><li data-video-id="showcase-5" class="aspect-[461/603] w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-[22rem] lg:w-[28.8125rem]"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Play Imran Chowdhury&#x27;s video, Accounting" class="relative block size-full cursor-pointer touch-manipulation overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] bg-[var(